---
import { cohort, site } from '../data/site';
---
<section class="pillars ground-night section" id="what-we-do" aria-labelledby="pillars-title">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head">
      <h2 id="pillars-title" class="display">What we do</h2>
      <p class="note">Start where you are: building a product, changing careers or applying for roles.</p>
    </div>

    <!-- One band per pillar; the shared name makes them an exclusive accordion -->
    <div class="bands">
      <details class="band band-advisory leaf" name="pillars">
        <summary>
          <span class="band-name">Advisory</span>
          <span class="band-tease">For founders and teams</span>
          <span class="band-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        </summary>
        <div class="band-body">
          <p>Clear requirements before you spend on building. We review your idea or product and set out what it needs, from a quick read to a viability review or a full feasibility study.</p>
          <a class="band-link" href={`mailto:${site.email}?subject=Advisory%20enquiry`}>Book a call</a>
        </div>
      </details>

      <details class="band band-training leaf" name="pillars" open>
        <summary>
          <span class="band-name">Training</span>
          <span class="band-tease">{cohort.programme}</span>
          <span class="band-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        </summary>
        <div class="band-body">
          <p>Twelve weeks of live, case-based training for people moving into IT business analysis. You work one change at a fictional bank, from the first brief to the board presentation.</p>
          <ul class="band-facts">
            <li>{cohort.schedule}</li>
            <li>{cohort.size} per cohort</li>
            <li>Next cohort: {cohort.next}</li>
          </ul>
          <a class="band-link" href="#how">See how a cohort works</a>
        </div>
      </details>

      <details class="band band-careers leaf" name="pillars">
        <summary>
          <span class="band-name">Careers</span>
          <span class="band-tease">For new and aspiring analysts</span>
          <span class="band-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        </summary>
        <div class="band-body">
          <p>A CV rewritten around business analysis work and a one-to-one mock interview, so your new skills come through on paper and in the room.</p>
          <a class="band-link" href={`mailto:${site.email}?subject=Careers%20support`}>Ask about careers support</a>
        </div>
      </details>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .bands {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-3);
  }

  /* Pillar colours. Text pairs checked for contrast:
     white on deep-green 10.4:1, night on leaf-green 5.5:1, white on forest-green 5.4:1 */
  .band-advisory {
    --band-bg: var(--deep-green);
    --band-fg: #ffffff;
  }

  .band-training {
    --band-bg: var(--leaf-green);
    --band-fg: var(--night);
  }

  .band-careers {
    --band-bg: var(--forest-green);
    --band-fg: #ffffff;
  }

  .band {
    background: var(--band-bg);
    color: var(--band-fg);
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  summary {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(0, 1.4fr) 44px;
    align-items: center;
    gap: var(--space-6);
    min-height: 84px;
    padding: var(--space-4) var(--space-6) var(--space-4) var(--space-8);
    list-style: none;
    cursor: pointer;
  }

  summary::-webkit-details-marker {
    display: none;
  }

  summary:focus-visible {
    outline: 3px solid var(--band-fg);
    outline-offset: -6px;
  }

  .band-name {
    font-size: clamp(24px, 2.4vw, 32px);
    line-height: 1.1;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
  }

  .band-tease {
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 20px;
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .band-icon {
    position: relative;
    width: 44px;
    height: 44px;
    border: 1.5px solid currentColor;
    border-radius: 50%;
    justify-self: end;
    transition: transform var(--duration-ui) var(--ease-out);
  }

  .band-icon::before,
  .band-icon::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    inset: 50% auto auto 50%;
    width: 14px;
    height: 1.5px;
    background: currentColor;
    transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
  }

  .band-icon::after {
    transform: translate(-50%, -50%) rotate(90deg);
  }

  .band[open] .band-icon {
    transform: rotate(45deg);
  }

  /* Open and close smoothly, so the bands below slide instead of jumping.
     Opening one band closes the other at the same time, so both heights ease together.
     Browsers without ::details-content keep the instant open. */
  .band::details-content {
    block-size: 0;
    opacity: 0;
    overflow: clip;
    transition:
      block-size var(--duration-panel) var(--ease-out),
      opacity var(--duration-ui) var(--ease-out),
      content-visibility var(--duration-panel) allow-discrete;
  }

  .band[open]::details-content {
    block-size: auto;
    opacity: 1;
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .band::details-content {
      transition:
        opacity var(--duration-ui) var(--ease-out),
        content-visibility var(--duration-ui) allow-discrete;
    }

    .band-icon {
      transition: none;
    }
  }

  .band-body {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(0, 1.4fr);
    gap: var(--space-4) var(--space-6);
    padding: var(--space-2) var(--space-8) var(--space-8);
  }

  .band-body p {
    grid-column: 2;
    max-width: 34em;
    font-size: 18px;
    line-height: 27px;
  }

  .band-facts {
    grid-column: 2;
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: var(--space-2);
  }

  .band-facts li {
    padding: 6px 14px;
    border: 1px solid currentColor;
    border-radius: var(--radius-pill);
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 20px;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .band-link {
    grid-column: 2;
    justify-self: start;
    margin-top: var(--space-2);
    font-weight: 700;
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-decoration-thickness: 1.5px;
    text-underline-offset: 5px;
  }

  .band-link:focus-visible {
    outline-color: var(--band-fg);
  }

  @media (max-width: 760px) {
    summary {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) 44px;
      row-gap: 2px;
      padding: var(--space-4) var(--space-4) var(--space-4) var(--space-6);
    }

    .band-name {
      grid-row: 1;
    }

    .band-tease {
      grid-row: 2;
      grid-column: 1;
    }

    .band-icon {
      grid-row: 1 / span 2;
      grid-column: 2;
    }

    .band-body {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
      padding: 0 var(--space-6) var(--space-6);
    }

    .band-body p,
    .band-facts,
    .band-link {
      grid-column: 1;
    }

    .band-body p {
      font-size: 17px;
      line-height: 26px;
    }
  }
</style>
